    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15348" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ē-jăcŭlor</span></b> ,
			ātus, 1, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. dep. a.</i> (and in the <i>act.</i> form: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">se in salum ejaculaverat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 16, 19, 21</span></i>
			), <i>to shoot out</i>, <i>to
			hurl</i> or <i>throw out</i> (rare, and not
			ante-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aquas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					4, 124</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. F. 1, 270</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">se in altum (sanguis),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. M.
					6, 259</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">umbram in forum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					4, 12, 23, § 73</span></i>
			.!*? <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ejaculari</span></b> , <i>pass.</i>, <i><span class="en">Scrib.
				Comp. 84</span></i>.</div>
